EXTERNAL set_flag(string, bool)

=== start ===
#speaker:player
An axe... Looks like someone left it here.

#speaker:player
Maybe I could use it.

#speaker:woodcutter
Don't touch my axe.

#speaker:player
What?!

#speaker:woodcutter
I said, don't touch it.

#speaker:player
...You were awake this whole time?

#speaker:woodcutter
No.

#speaker:woodcutter
But I am now.

~ set_flag("WoodcutterAwakened", true)
-> END
